{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_049_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:59832defa858aa416403c556a26abf9e8b420f6685e32e699221b7417a2309c8",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3217e563133326498e384147860c27e2720d7378dd44f4af3e906e8b2cc09103",
      "text": "没那回事！用喜欢的工作来激发干劲，\n我觉得也绝不是什么坏事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c985d4b9b3ff7badafcb6b817e46f5afab7953c075b6f7406d23f3077fc37d7",
      "text": "……不，但是……我……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47294ddf7d91f2bc8e3a22845cc7afb3e1cc4a2bb33f9efa1e2375d86a03f6ed",
      "text": "而且，看到锐心先生享受工作的样子，\n粉丝们也会露出笑容的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063a85459cbee5521bfbfaa9034176defd37a332e865012e6a758370b62b3c96",
      "text": "……也是啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:697ec9646406c17887bcd883a824168f219ef8f5c3f1163ecdbfba5d75d8ed5e",
      "text": "陪我花了这么长时间。我送你一段路吧。\n别落下东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000052:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c45255d4c4c85003d40e98acaf529841cf0c4bcca3d12f2b66549f0c32f25e2",
      "text": "锐心先生！恭喜你。\n试镜通过了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e419677a7a3af6411207a5c4cc5cc6bcb3d8e22aa860e38ffc76db418042183",
      "text": "嗯。为了不玷污导演的作品，\n也是为了粉丝，我会倾尽全力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65ea75e2e0131989d236de563051085f0a1d5b26294418722cbe2885b8e728b4",
      "text": "作为制作人，为了工作本身，\n如果锐心先生自己也能乐在其中，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e41893baa8e4b95474bd02e1b15271a1b1c8007dc0e8c1152ea886cf77069e3d",
      "text": "……真固执啊。……不过我也没资格说别人就是了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_049eis_01_1_2_049_01:1_2_049_01_e:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50b1acb6c743869d82446485c3d7bf87ebf71be18bf72e8614e94e2511c916df",
      "text": "我明白了。既然你说有这个必要的话……\n为了让我自己也能享受其中，我会试着努力一下的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
